<title>THAILAND: Thai rice vessels loading and movements at Jan 15.</title>
<headline>Thai rice vessels loading and movements at Jan 15.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Thai Commerce Ministry and independent surveyors detailed rice loading at Thai ports as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>Vessel		Date of Arrival   Quantity     Destination</p>
<p>Tong Shun	   25/11/96		3,000	  Vietnam</p>
<p>Seenes		12/12/96		1,300	  Philippines</p>
<p>Zang San	    26/12/96		8,500	  Taiwan</p>
<p>Luck Tearl	  02/01/97	     10,000	  Iran</p>
<p>Minfortune	  02/01/97		5,000	  Singapore</p>
<p>Bang Khun Prom    03/01/97		4,500	  Malaysia</p>
<p>Saeng Thai Radium 03/01/97		5,000	  Singapore</p>
<p>Lori		  03/01/97		4,000	  Philippines</p>
<p>Tolarftar	   06/01/97	     20,000	  Iraq</p>
<p>Roxan		 06/01/97		5,000	  Philippines</p>
<p>Kiatbaru	    07/01/97		4,500	  Japan</p>
<p>Sengcheng	   07/01/97		5,000	  Singapore</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
